      "title": "圣阳华彩·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "41804001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "深夜时分，街区的某个角落——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御景熏",
          "text": "虚假之影，速速返回！回到真实之地——显形！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御景熏",
          "text": "八咫镜指示的地方，应该就是这里了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御景熏",
          "text": "果然，你躲到这里来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "………………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御景熏",
          "text": "嗯，睡得很香嘛。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御景熏",
          "text": "如果你能一直这么乖，我们的关系或许就不会这么紧张。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御景熏",
          "text": "身体似乎没什么异常，但愿白天的那种异常的感觉是我多虑了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御景熏",
          "text": "放心，你体内的「祂」，我一定会想办法清除的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804010",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "诡异的声音打破了深夜的静谧——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "呃……唔……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "放开……放开……我……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "天照",
          "text": "这具身体，终于属于我了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "天照",
          "text": "呵，御景熏……吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "天照",
          "text": "狂妄之辈，将会得到神罚。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "你……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "天照",
          "text": "你太虚弱了，放弃挣扎吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "天照",
          "text": "亵渎神明的罪，我会亲手惩戒。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804019",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "爱猫社区，主人家中。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御景熏",
          "text": "抱歉，这么晚登门拜访。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "41804022",
              "text": "乐意奉陪。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "41804022",
              "text": "有烦心事？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "41804021",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御景熏",
          "text": "嗯，我看人的眼光很准，你果然是一个值得倾心托付的人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "41804024",
              "text": "具体是什么事？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "41804024",
              "text": "看起来很严重？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "41804023",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御景熏",
          "text": "事关我的弟弟，卡缪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御景熏",
          "text": "由于某种历史遗留原因，他的体内封印着「天照大御神」的灵体——而这本来应该由我这个家族巫女来背负。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御景熏",
          "text": "我比谁都清楚，作为天照大御神的容器，等待他的将是怎样可悲又可怖的命运……因此，我必须做点什么。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "41804028",
              "text": "你想让我怎么帮你？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "41804027",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御景熏",
          "text": "别紧张，只不过需要你在必要的时候为我提供支持，不会让你为难的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御景熏",
          "text": "我一向喜欢双赢，我想你也不愿意轻易涉险。\n因此在正式开始合作之前，还有许多细节需要说明白。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41804030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "御景熏",
          "text": "唔，我有多个方案可以供你选择……不介意的话，或许我们可以移步详谈？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
